# AI suggestion feature — set ANY ONE of these (tried in this order):
#   1. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  — direct Anthropic Messages API (recommended; most reliable)
#   2. GEMINI_API_KEY     — Google Gemini, free tier (1500/day) — gemini-2.0-flash
#   3. AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY — Vercel AI Gateway (requires a billing card on the gateway account)
#
# Without any of these, the AI button shows a graceful "not configured" notice
# and everything else works.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=

# NOTE: eticket.railway.gov.bd credentials are NOT set here — each user pastes
# their own token in the browser (stored in localStorage only). No shared secret.
